<BaseLayout title="In Memoriam | AMD FFL"><main><section class="page-head"><div class="shell"><div class="eyebrow">Forever part of the league</div><h1>In Memoriam</h1><p>Remembering the owners who helped make the AMD Fantasy Football League what it is.</p></div></section><section class="shell memorial"><article class="tribute"><div class="portrait"><img src="https://amdffl.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/terry.jpg" alt="Terry Kennedy"/><div class="identity"><span>ORIGINAL OWNER</span><h2>Terry Kennedy</h2><strong>Cathedral Golden Gales</strong></div></div><div class="story"><div class="eyebrow">The Glue. My Rival.</div><p>Terry Kennedy was an original owner and 1 of the toughest competitors in this league. If he made it to the playoffs, he was going all the way. He made it to 8 Championship games in 16 1/2 seasons. Football was important to him. He often told family to not call during gametime, “I'm playing Fantasy Football.” He loved Canada and the animals that came to his yard. We had several conversations about the wildlife that visited him.</p><p>For all of the conversations that we had, and the opinions he gave, he kept to himself. No wife or family close, he didn't share his health. He always let on that he was ok. He had several heart attacks and spent time in the hospital where we had no idea. He enlisted in the Canadian military when he was 17.</p><p>Thank you for all the memories and everything that you brought and gave to this league. You are 1 of the reasons that this league has lasted this long. The glue. My rival. I called hospitals looking for you at the start. And now at the end.</p><blockquote>You will always be part of this league as we will name the Championship after you. You had been there so many times over the years, it only makes sense.</blockquote></div></article><div class="legacy"><span>4×</span><strong>LEAGUE CHAMPION</strong><span>8</span><strong>CHAMPIONSHIP APPEARANCES</strong><span>11</span><strong>POSTSEASON APPEARANCES</strong></div><div class="cathedral"><small>HIS LEGACY LIVES ON IN</small><h3>THE CATHEDRAL BOWL</h3><p>The league championship carries Terry's team name forward every season.</p></div></section></main><style>.page-head{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0,rgba(213,169,70,.1),transparent 38%)}.page-head p{max-width:720px;color:var(--muted);font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.65}.memorial{padding:48px 0 76px}.tribute{display:grid;grid-template-columns:310px 1fr;gap:46px;padding:34px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#121820,#0c1116)}.portrait img{display:block;width:100%;border-radius:7px;filter:grayscale(18%);box-shadow:0 18px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}.identity{padding-top:20px}.identity span{color:var(--accent);font-size:.65rem;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.13em}.identity h2{margin:7px 0 3px;font-size:2rem}.identity strong{color:#aab4be}.story p{color:#c0c7ce;font-size:1.02rem;line-height:1.78}.story blockquote{margin:28px 0 0;padding:22px 25px;border-left:3px solid var(--accent);background:#0a0f14;color:#f2f3f4;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700;line-height:1.6}.legacy{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr auto 1fr auto 1fr;gap:12px 18px;align-items:center;margin-top:18px;padding:24px 28px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:#0e141a}.legacy span{color:var(--accent);font-size:2rem;font-weight:900}.legacy strong{color:#9ca7b2;font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.08em}.cathedral{text-align:center;margin-top:38px;padding:34px 20px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.cathedral small{color:#798590;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.15em}.cathedral h3{margin:8px 0;color:var(--accent);font-size:2.1rem}.cathedral p{color:var(--muted)}@media(max-width:760px){.tribute{grid-template-columns:1fr}.portrait{max-width:320px;margin:auto}.legacy{grid-template-columns:auto 1fr}}</style></BaseLayout>